# Keep LF everywhere, on every platform.
# The SHA-256 digests in evaluation/source-freeze.json and corpus.lock.json are taken
# over file bytes. Without this, a Windows checkout would rewrite line endings and the
# frozen digests would no longer verify. Reproducibility depends on this file.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.gguf binary
*.tar.gz binary
*.sqlite binary
*.svg text eol=lf
*.jsonl text eol=lf
